{"id":"chatcmpl-b12705bbd67076fe","object":"chat.completion","created":1788642352,"model":"qwen38flashnext","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\n\nThe complete proverb is:\n\n**“A stitch in time saves nine.”**\n\nIt means that fixing a small problem early can prevent it from becoming a much bigger problem later.\n\nFor example, if you repair a small tear in clothing right away, you only need one stitch. If you wait, the tear may get bigger and need nine stitches—or even replacement. More generally, the proverb encourages acting promptly and dealing with issues before they grow.","refusal":null,"annotations":null,"audio":null,"function_call":null,"reasoning":"We need answer user: \"Complete the proverb and explain it: A stitch in time\". Simple. Final should complete proverb \"saves nine\" and explain: fix problem early prevents bigger issues. Could mention origin sewing. Concise.\n"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","stop_reason":null,"token_ids":null,"routed_experts":null}],"service_tier":null,"system_fingerprint":"vllm-0.28.1rc1.dev446+g798544433-tp4-ep-72ccc4a5","usage":{"prompt_tokens":63,"total_tokens":204,"completion_tokens":141,"prompt_tokens_details":null,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":48}},"prompt_logprobs":null,"prompt_token_ids":null,"prompt_text":null,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"metrics":null}